# wx16 - 16x16 weather icons.
#
# These are a "font" rather than a separate bitmap format on purpose: the icon
# set then reuses fontgen, the glyph blitter, and the clip logic with no extra
# code. The icon widget maps a WMO weather code to a category 0-9 and draws the
# matching character.
#
#   48 '0'  clear          51 '3'  overcast      54 '6'  rain      57 '9'  storm
#   49 '1'  fair           52 '4'  fog           55 '7'  snow
#   50 '2'  cloudy         53 '5'  drizzle       56 '8'  showers

@name     wx16
@role     icons
@height   16
@baseline 16
@gap      0
@family   wx
@smooth   no

# clear: full sun with eight rays
48  ................/.......##......./.......##......./..#...####...#../...#.######.#.../....########..../...##########.../##.##########.##/##.##########.##/...##########.../....########..../...#.######.#.../..#...####...#../.......##......./.......##......./................

# fair: large sun, small cloud tucked into the lower right
49  ................/.....##........./.....##........./..#..####..#..../...########...../..##########..../#..########..#../#..########..#../..##########..../...########...../..#..####..#..../.....##....####./.....##..######./.......########./........#######./................

# cloudy: sun peeking out from behind a cloud
50  ..####........../.######........./########......../########......../.######........./..####....##..../.......######.../....##########../..############../################/################/.##############./................/................/................/................

# overcast: cloud alone
51  ................/................/................/................/......####....../....########..../...##########.../.############.../##############../################/################/.##############./................/................/................/................

# fog: stacked drifting bars
52  ................/................/..############../................/................/....############/................/................/##############../................/................/..############../................/................/................/................

# drizzle: cloud with sparse light dots
53  ................/................/......####....../....########..../...##########.../.############.../##############../################/################/.##############./................/...#...#...#..../................/....#...#...#.../................/................

